    "detailed_description": "&quot;The big dream will wake up&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Several cycles of reincarnation&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010 Temple in the mountains, humming nursery rhymes \u3011<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Five treasures scattered, five treasures separated, five treasures scattered, fairies hidden.&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Five offerings, five offerings, five offerings, and become immortal.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010 Fate system \u3011<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers can consume items, random lives, lives can meet specific NPCS in the game map, and complete quests to earn powerful cards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010 Schools of exercises \u3011<br />\r\nAfter the player chooses a skill, he may not upgrade to a different deck.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010 Five-element system \u3011<br />\r\nEquipment card: The powerful effect of equipment card.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010 Magical Journey \u3011<br />\r\nPlayers can offer sacrifices, and items collected on the map earn powerful cards",
